---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Terms of Use"
  num="§"
  label="Terms"
  description={`The terms for using ${site.name}'s website and contact form.`}
>
  <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>{site.name}</strong> is a team of college students in Thailand that builds software,
    tools, services and devices. We are staying anonymous for now. You can reach us through the
    contact form or the email address on the <a href="/#contact">contact section</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Using this website</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>You may browse and use this website for lawful, personal or business purposes.</li>
    <li>
      Do not attack, overload or probe the site or the contact form, or use them to send spam,
      malware or anything unlawful.
    </li>
    <li>
      The Tetris game and other small features are provided for fun, as they are, with no promise
      that they will always be available.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Contact form</h2>
  <p>
    When you send a message you confirm that the details you give are yours to share and that you
    have read the <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>. Sending a message does not create a
    contract or promise that we will take on your project; we reply to discuss it first.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Email updates are optional.</strong> We only send updates if you tick the separate
    "email me updates" box, and you can withdraw at any time by telling us.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Our content</h2>
  <p>
    The text, logo, artwork and code of this website belong to {site.name} unless stated otherwise.
    Please don't copy the logo or present our work as yours. Our open-source projects are covered by
    the licence stated in each project.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Projects and information</h2>
  <p>
    Information about our projects and services is general and may change or be incomplete while we
    are still building. Nothing on this site is professional, legal, medical or financial advice.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Links to other sites</h2>
  <p>
    We link to third-party sites (for example GitHub, Facebook and Instagram). We don't control them
    and aren't responsible for their content or privacy practices.
  </p>

  <h2>7. No warranty and limits of liability</h2>
  <p>
    The website is provided "as is". To the extent allowed by law, we are not liable for losses that
    come from using, or not being able to use, this website.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Changes and governing law</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these terms; the version number above changes when we do. These terms are governed
    by the laws of Thailand.
  </p>

  <h2>9. Questions</h2>
  <p>
    Contact us through the <a href="/#contact">contact section</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
